      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We have found that a series of N-(5-bromosalicylidene) alkylamines exhibited distinct chromic behaviour depending on the parity of their alkyl chain length. A group with an even number of carbon atoms in the alkyl chain showed photochromism, while another group with odd number showed thermochromism."},
